    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικῠλ-ινδέω</span></b> , later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικῠλ-κυλίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, fut. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλίσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					115.21
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εκύλῑσα</span>
				:—<i>roll round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ὀνίδα] περικυλίσας τοῖν ποδοῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικυλίοντες εἰς τὴν γῆν τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.34
			</span></i> :— 
				Pass.
			, of an infant, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.85
			</span></i> ; of the shoulder in reducing dislocation, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).327
			</span></i> : abs., <i>roll about</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				893e
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>to be involved in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιαίοις πράγμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					42.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				2.206
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἕτερα πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.572
				</span></i>
			.</div>
